==Battleground==
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*[[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Bake-Neko|Bake-Neko]] are feline [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Yōkai|yōkai]] appearing throughout the ''[[wikipedia:GeGeGe no Kitarō|GeGeGe no Kitarō]]'' franchise.

